We incorporated this mechanistic structure into a stochastic model, where all contributions from time t to t + 1 were drawn from binomial or Poisson distributions. For instance, the total new number of infected individuals, Ni,t, was obtained as a random draw from a Poisson distribution with expected value\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
